"""
The native plan, by the names lowering and its callers import: plain data for native bodies, independent of rustc's
internal types, and the plan records that retain it.

The types and codecs are the Rust Loaf `incan_mir_plan_native`. Local zero is the return place; parameters occupy the
next locals in declaration order. Blocks are indexed from zero. Every source-bearing node keeps its Incan location,
including operands and places, so native diagnostics retain provenance.
"""

